    <p class="cost-page-intro">
      Planning a robotic knee replacement involves both clinical and financial decisions.
      At <strong>DHS Multispecialty Hospital, Ahmedabad</strong>, we believe every patient deserves
      clear, written answers before admission. This guide breaks down the real cost of
      robotic knee surgery in Gujarat, explains what your health insurance actually covers,
      clarifies waiting periods, and outlines how our dedicated
      <strong>TPA &amp; Billing Desk</strong> manages insurance approvals on your behalf.
    </p>

    <!-- ── Two-column grid ── -->
    <div class="cost-layout">

